TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Mankenlerin üstünde her şey ne
kadar güzel duruyor,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} değil mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ne alacağıma bir türlü karar veremiyorum.

EN:
I do own a pocket guide to fashion,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}
but I always have too much in my
pockets to carry it.

TRANSLATION:
Aslında cep boy bir moda rehberim var,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}
ama ceplerim hep o kadar dolu ki
yanıma alamıyorum.

FR:
J'essaie toujours avant d'acheter
quoi que ce soit. Sauf la fois où{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0003:001B:}}
Bref, je préfère ne pas en parler.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Sometimes,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I just want to put on
something outrageous.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0015:}}You know,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
like what you wear.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Sai, vorrei avere il tuo coraggio...{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
e vestirmi ignorando completamente
le ultime tendenze della moda!
